<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Australia shortlists airport bids - Fahey.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Australia shortlists airport bids - Fahey.</headline>
<dateline>CANBERRA 1997-03-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Australian Finance Minister John Fahey said on Wednesday the government had shortlisted 13 bids from six consortiums for the first stage of its sale of government airports around the country.</p>
</text>
